  "panoSealingWarning": "The ILP system requires a fully sealed cabinet (UL/FM test requirement). Because of the marked unsealable opening, this system is not reliable — seal the panel or switch to the CO₂ agent group (DHP/IHP, sealing not required).",
  "panoCo2ToxicityWarning": "CO₂ is toxic: people must not be continuously present around the panel. If there is a leak risk into adjacent/neighboring areas, the 5% LOAEL limit must be observed, and evacuation and ventilation planned if necessary.",
  "panoNoSealingRequiredNote": "Sealing is not mandatory, but the amount of unsealable opening must be reported to the manufacturer; it must be accounted for as additional agent quantity in the VdS 2093 calculation.",
  "panoDesignRequirementsTitle": "Design Requirements",
  "panoManualReleaseNote": "• Manual discharge button: since the tubing line in {kod} systems is separate, an emergency manual discharge button is required in addition to automatic triggering.\n",
  "@panoManualReleaseNote": {
